Ethar.GeoPose.H3

This product includes software developed by Uber Technologies, Inc. (https://github.com/uber/h3), ported to C# by Ethar Inc.

Changes made by Ethar Inc.: translated from C to C#, restricted to the cell indexing subset of H3 v4.5.0 (index inspection, position to cell, cell to position and boundary, hierarchy and resolution metrics). Lookup tables are generated from the Uber sources by Ethar.GeoPose.H3.UnitTests/Tools/generate-tables.py.

